  textRenderer: {fileID: 2124574592}
  dialogueList:
  - Today is the day I start my new job.
  - I always wanted to be a miner!
  - They promised me that as long as I work hard enough I'll get to see my family
    again.
  - I hope they won't make me work for too long, I already miss them!
  - 
  - I must gather five baskets worth of coal today.
